    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "VEO3_GENERATOR",
        "description": "Inputs:\n• Type — Defines the video style: ASMR, Selfie Style Vlogger, Street Interview, or Cinematic\n• Description — A short scene or subject (e.g. “glass strawberry” or “stormtrooper in Imperial Transport”)\n• First Frame (optional): Enter an image URL to use as the video’s first frame when animating an image. Leave blank to generate the video from text only.\n\nWhat It Does:\nThis tool generates VEO3 videos tailored to the selected video type. It applies specific narrative and stylistic structures for each format:\n\n• ASMR — Creates macro-focused, sensory-rich slicing scenes with meditative sound cues\n• Selfie Style Vlogger — Builds first-person vlogs with direct speech, handheld framing, and ambient detail\n• Street Interview — Simulates news-style interviews with dialogue, environmental texture, and dynamic reactions\n• Cinematic — Produces filmic scenes with motion direction, mood, and immersive action/dialogue\n\nSpeech Limit:\nSpoken lines are kept short, around 18 words per speaker max, to ensure natural pacing in 8 second scenes.\n\nExecution Warning:\nThis action should only execute once. It consumes credits even on failure, so if an error occurs, return the error without retrying.\n\nOutput:\n• video_view_url – a shareable link to view the video in a browser (Google Drive preview)\n• video_download_url – a direct link to download the video file. This is used if you need to provide the video to another service.\n• prompt - the prompt that was used to generate this video",
